    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, <strong>idle medieval inn and town management game</strong> that thrives while you're doing your stuff. Dock it at the bottom of your screen, grow your tavern into a bustling town, and keep the ale flowing. <br><br><strong>Build, Brew &amp; Belong.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tidehaven: Ale &amp; Trade</i> is a cozy yet authentic medieval inn <strong>management &amp; automation &amp; design</strong> game designed to fit your day. Dock it at the <strong>bottom of your screen</strong> and let your tavern hum along while you work or jump in to micromanage rush hours, strike shady deals, and expand a sleepy inn into a lively town. <br><br><strong>From Inn to a Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and <strong>grow room by room</strong>: kitchen, bedroom, market, stable,<strong> a secret meeting room for under-the-table trades</strong>, and more. Grow your village beyond the inn, build <strong>stable</strong>, <strong>butcher</strong>, <strong>blacksmith</strong> and more to <strong>shape your town</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.poster.avif?t=1755260418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.webm?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.mp4?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize everything</strong><br><br>Unlock <strong>tons of decor</strong> and decorate your space in any style you like, you can even paint each tile on the floor! And some of these decoration items have a surprising bit of lore and <strong>buff system</strong> too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy medieval vibe</strong><br><br>Set between the 15th-17th centuries, Tidehaven pairs crackling hearths and clinking tankards with a <strong>medieval-to-lo-fi</strong> soundtrack that makes time drift by. Strengthen your economy while expanding your tavern in most fashion way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.poster.avif?t=1755260418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.webm?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.mp4?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this game something for you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Docked \u201cbottom-of-screen\u201d mode</strong> for effortless second-screen play sound appealing?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn to town</strong>: Do you enjoy developing your place in your own style and discovering different mechanics and dynamics with each new building?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let staff automation &amp; supply chains</strong> that keep the ale (and coins) flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore tons of stylish decor</strong> and <strong>perk-granting items</strong> to style and optimize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try side events &amp; mini-games</strong> that spice up your routine with risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets?</strong> Oh, we like pets. Name your <strong>dog</strong>, breed<strong> horses</strong>, and if you\u2019re lucky keep a rare <strong>parrot</strong> in your room too. <strong>Fishing</strong>? Hmm\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And here is <strong>no punishing gameplay</strong> with constant difficulties that need perfect planning. Faster, chiller, relaxing, min-maxing, <strong>every way is a right way here</strong>. No plague carts, no witch hunts, no non-stop raids! Put your fireplace, take a fresh ale, and do a little automation.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re here for <strong>cozy decorating</strong> and \u201colden days\u201d vibes or for <strong>laid-back economic tinkering</strong>, your story begins in Tidehaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy, <strong>idle medieval inn and town management game</strong> that thrives while you're doing your stuff. Dock it at the bottom of your screen, grow your tavern into a bustling town, and keep the ale flowing. <br><br><strong>Build, Brew &amp; Belong.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tidehaven: Ale &amp; Trade</i> is a cozy yet authentic medieval inn <strong>management &amp; automation &amp; design</strong> game designed to fit your day. Dock it at the <strong>bottom of your screen</strong> and let your tavern hum along while you work or jump in to micromanage rush hours, strike shady deals, and expand a sleepy inn into a lively town. <br><br><strong>From Inn to a Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and <strong>grow room by room</strong>: kitchen, bedroom, market, stable,<strong> a secret meeting room for under-the-table trades</strong>, and more. Grow your village beyond the inn, build <strong>stable</strong>, <strong>butcher</strong>, <strong>blacksmith</strong> and more to <strong>shape your town</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.poster.avif?t=1755260418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.webm?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/1d40ab510d1354ec44476c31d7b14936.mp4?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize everything</strong><br><br>Unlock <strong>tons of decor</strong> and decorate your space in any style you like, you can even paint each tile on the floor! And some of these decoration items have a surprising bit of lore and <strong>buff system</strong> too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy medieval vibe</strong><br><br>Set between the 15th-17th centuries, Tidehaven pairs crackling hearths and clinking tankards with a <strong>medieval-to-lo-fi</strong> soundtrack that makes time drift by. Strengthen your economy while expanding your tavern in most fashion way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.poster.avif?t=1755260418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.webm?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691420/extras/b7b28803436e5e21cf1112d2ae39db33.mp4?t=1755260418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is this game something for you?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Docked \u201cbottom-of-screen\u201d mode</strong> for effortless second-screen play sound appealing?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inn to town</strong>: Do you enjoy developing your place in your own style and discovering different mechanics and dynamics with each new building?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let staff automation &amp; supply chains</strong> that keep the ale (and coins) flowing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore tons of stylish decor</strong> and <strong>perk-granting items</strong> to style and optimize your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try side events &amp; mini-games</strong> that spice up your routine with risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pets?</strong> Oh, we like pets. Name your <strong>dog</strong>, breed<strong> horses</strong>, and if you\u2019re lucky keep a rare <strong>parrot</strong> in your room too. <strong>Fishing</strong>? Hmm\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And here is <strong>no punishing gameplay</strong> with constant difficulties that need perfect planning. Faster, chiller, relaxing, min-maxing, <strong>every way is a right way here</strong>. No plague carts, no witch hunts, no non-stop raids! Put your fireplace, take a fresh ale, and do a little automation.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re here for <strong>cozy decorating</strong> and \u201colden days\u201d vibes or for <strong>laid-back economic tinkering</strong>, your story begins in Tidehaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
